{
  "slug": "cdc-debezium-avancado",
  "title": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "1b59abc2-6d49-48be-bc25-a0087ac3829c",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 0,
      "data": {
        "title": "CDC: ler o log de transações, não a tabela"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "d820857e-90f0-4fd3-8de4-ec5f2822db73",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Change Data Capture lê o log interno do banco (MySQL binlog, Postgres WAL via logical replication, Mongo oplog, SQL Server CDC, Oracle LogMiner) para capturar toda mudança em ordem. Debezium é um conjunto de Kafka Connect source connectors que transforma esses logs em eventos Avro/JSON. "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "07a25238-248a-456b-8ea5-8de7045753a8",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "variant": "warning",
            "title": "",
            "content": "CDC não é \"query com filtro updated_at\". Polling perde DELETE, perde updates rápidos e sobrecarrega a tabela. Binlog/WAL é o único caminho correto em produção."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7a344ac1-e2e8-407c-ad81-e2e296da85a5",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 1,
      "data": {
        "title": "Connector Postgres típico"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "fa5f165a-3992-4096-be7c-12924374d530",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "json",
            "code": "{\n  \"name\": \"orders-pg-source\",\n  \"config\": {\n    \"connector.class\": \"io.debezium.connector.postgresql.PostgresConnector\",\n    \"database.hostname\": \"pg.internal\",\n    \"database.port\": \"5432\",\n    \"database.user\": \"debezium\",\n    \"database.password\": \"${file:/secrets/pg.pass}\",\n    \"database.dbname\": \"orders\",\n    \"plugin.name\": \"pgoutput\",\n    \"slot.name\": \"debezium_orders\",\n    \"publication.name\": \"dbz_pub\",\n    \"topic.prefix\": \"pg.orders\",\n    \"table.include.list\": \"public.orders,public.order_items,public.outbox\",\n    \"snapshot.mode\": \"initial\",\n    \"heartbeat.interval.ms\": \"10000\",\n    \"tombstones.on.delete\": \"true\",\n    \"key.converter\": \"io.confluent.connect.avro.AvroConverter\",\n    \"value.converter\": \"io.confluent.connect.avro.AvroConverter\",\n    \"value.converter.schema.registry.url\": \"http://registry:8081\"\n  }\n}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "c142816c-b28f-486e-9c06-a51f1fe16b6d",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "Heartbeat é crítico em Postgres: sem movimento no WAL em tabelas watched, o slot não avança e o WAL enche o disco. Heartbeat força progresso periódico."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "108e3f17-32fa-4d29-adf0-e937dda01b96",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 2,
      "data": {
        "title": "Envelope de evento CDC"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "a2dc59ad-11c3-4131-8d31-eaa73bc8d95f",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "json",
            "code": "{\n  \"op\": \"u\",\n  \"ts_ms\": 1713528000123,\n  \"source\": {\n    \"db\": \"orders\", \"schema\": \"public\", \"table\": \"orders\",\n    \"lsn\": 281474976710899, \"txId\": 98123\n  },\n  \"before\": { \"id\": \"o-42\", \"status\": \"PENDING\", \"totalCents\": 12990 },\n  \"after\":  { \"id\": \"o-42\", \"status\": \"PAID\",    \"totalCents\": 12990 }\n}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "d2a0f9a3-9a5c-4f0c-98dc-f65bd2734655",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " op: c (create), u (update), d (delete), r (read do snapshot). before/after permitem reconstruir diff sem ambiguidade. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c55d03f0-6610-47ed-9d4d-94c218985871",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 3,
      "data": {
        "title": "Schema changes: não podem quebrar consumer"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "05f28a00-15cb-4a5c-acb0-7441d1614908",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " ALTER TABLE em produção propaga via binlog. Debezium emite evento de schema change; seu pipeline precisa de compatibility BACKWARD no registry e consumers tolerantes a campos novos. Drop column é o caso perigoso: trate como deprecation gradual (stop writes, wait retention, drop). "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c988118d-d133-4d3a-954a-ff751c95ed12",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 4,
      "data": {
        "title": "Dual write é bug; outbox é a resposta"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "d05e7b33-d685-420e-9ca7-f1bd32a0578a",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "sql",
            "code": "-- Na mesma transação do write de negócio\nBEGIN;\nUPDATE orders SET status = 'PAID' WHERE id = 'o-42';\nINSERT INTO outbox (id, aggregate_type, aggregate_id, event_type, payload)\nVALUES (gen_random_uuid(), 'order', 'o-42', 'OrderPaid',\n        '{\"orderId\":\"o-42\",\"paidAt\":\"2026-04-19T12:00:00Z\"}'::jsonb);\nCOMMIT;\n-- Debezium lê outbox; SMT ExtractNewRecordState roteia para topic orders.events"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "6bd07fb4-088a-40ce-af89-50703d92c96b",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "variant": "success",
            "title": "",
            "content": "Essa é a base do próximo capítulo (outbox). Commit atômico no DB, Kafka recebe via CDC. Zero dual write, zero inconsistência silenciosa."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}